          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. Akshi says that the perimeter of this triangle shape is 9 units. Toshi says it can’t be 9 units and the perimeter will be more than 9 units. What do you think?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.864,
            0.882,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. The perimeter will be more than 9 units as the length of a diagonal of a square is always greater than the sides of the square."
            }
          ]
